  "title": "Bossa Nova",
  "summary": "Bossa nova was a Brazilian musical movement that took shape in Rio de Janeiro from 1958. It recast samba with a simplified guitar beat and unusual harmonies, centred on Tom Jobim and João Gilberto, whose 'Chega de Saudade' became his first bossa nova hit in 1958. It lasted until about 1963.",
